    "description": "What: Simulated devices SD-S1 (§5a, D-1''). The OP vehicle is the observer HMMWV (TKB 120): its type PRE-MOUNTS a laser rangefinder in the device station (seat 7) that its COMMANDER seat (6) operates. A scripted trainee possesses the Commander sitting in seat 6, binds his view to the vehicle's rangefinder, aims at a marker 450 m away and presses RANGE. Judge: (1) the rangefinder is in the vehicle's station (seat 7) and the Commander in his own seat (6) - the seat holds HIM, not the device; (2) the device is operated by his station (its PossessedBy row: Operated); (3) the range to the marker is 450 m (within 3 m) and the laser met the marker. Fail: the device is missing, unoperated, or measures nothing. Check: scripts/scenario-regression.sh dv-vehicle-station"
  },
